     I think you've hit upon the reason, but you're asking
the wrong question.  The current setting is what matters,
and odds are that it got accidentally toggled off during
the present game via the 'O' command.  Since the current
value persists across save/restore cycles, any config file
setting is irrelevant at this point.  [It could have been
disabled in the file prior to the start of the current game,
but it is highly unlikely that someone who deliberately did
that would turn around and ask why pet behavior has changed.]

     Despite the general confusion earlier in this thread,
a new moon has no effect on pets or on taming.  [A full moon
does affect taming of dogs with thrown food.]


